{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "301e0a8b-4130-8a04-914d-a180e60160bd",
  "created_at": "2025-12-23T10:17:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linda B. Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:14:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Newport Recreation, this is Beth. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:14:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Linda Almy. I am calling about a memorial bench. I would like to buy one for a beach or a park in Newport."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:14:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, absolutely, we get those requests. Do you have a particular spot in mind, like one of the beaches, or a park?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:14:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would prefer a beach, if it is possible. I do not know yet which one. I need to know what the process is and who decides the location."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:14:59-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. So generally you'd submit a request with the location you'd like and the wording for a plaque, and it gets reviewed to see if that spot can take a bench. Sometimes a location is full or there's a waiting list, so they may offer you a second choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:15:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. And who do I send the request to? Is it a form, or a letter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:15:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's an application form. I can email it to you, or you can pick one up here at the office. Which would be easier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:15:33-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Email is better, but I should tell you something. I work as a bartender on weekends, so I sleep late on weekdays. If I do not answer the phone in the morning, please do not take it as a refusal. Please leave a message or send an email."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:15:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, I'll note that. Mornings are bad, so email first. Can I get your email address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:15:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would rather give you my phone number now, and you can call me after noon. It is 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:16:07-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0185, afternoons. And I'll make a note that you're interested in a beach location. Once you have the form filled out, you send it back here to the recreation office and it goes to review."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:16:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please repeat that last part slowly. I want to write it down exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:16:27-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Fill out the memorial bench application. Choose your preferred location and write the plaque wording. Return it to the Recreation Department. Then it's reviewed for the location and the bench type."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:16:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Fill out the application, choose location, write plaque wording, return to Recreation, then review. That is correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:16:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's exactly right. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:16:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you for your time. Happy holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-23T10:16:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy holidays to you too, Linda. Take care!"
    }
  ],
